- **Geometric (Cis-Trans) Isomerism**: Isimers with the same structural structure but different spatial arrangements.  
- **Diastereomeric Isisomerism**: Isimers with the same structural structure but different spatial arrangements.  
- **Enantiomeric Isisomerism**: Isimers with the same structural structure but different spatial arrangements.  

