\]
The partial derivatives at the point \((4,2,-2)\) are:
\[
x = 4, \quad y = 2, \quad z = -2 \implies
2x = 2(4) = 8, \quad
2y = 2(2) = 4, \quad
18z = 18(-2) = -36.
\]
